  "gaps": [
    "Ledger reflects the standard GuidedPath track (BUS2007, 39 elective credits), which sums to 180 quarter credits. Students assessed as needing additional support must take ACS1003 Building Skills for Academic Success (6 quarter credits) in their first quarter, then take BUS2003 (6) instead of BUS2007, and their electives drop to 33 quarter credits. The total is still 180.",
    "The total also requires a minimum of 54 quarter credits from the 3000-level and above. This is not itemized as a separate ledger line.",
    "The general education block requires at least 4 quarter credits from each category (Communication, Humanities, Natural Science and Mathematics, Social Science). Per-course credit values in the captured general education list (p. 148) are column-scrambled and cannot be reliably attributed to individual courses.",
    "Optional Honors Pathway (at least 15 quarter credits: PHI-H2005 3, COM-H4005 6, SOC-H3005 6) applies toward the general education requirement. It is not listed as separate lines.",
    "The capture does not state residency or institutional-credit requirements, transfer credit limits, or minimum grade/GPA requirements.",
    "The FlexPath option (program points) is a separate delivery model, and its capture is truncated after the specialization courses. It is not included in this ledger."
  ],
